      "writtenOn": "2020-05-18T16:44:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i am confused by this. Is the AP requsting this information? Why aren\u0027t we processing this in the hostcommand task? There are already buffers for request and response there.\n\nAlso, don\u0027t we need to send an event (either MKBP or HOST_EVENT) to the AP so it can initiate the host command request.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "0357f1b2d4c059795f86baca4ac5d9526bde16ea",
