        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-19T06:02:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jett: Is there a clean way to route this through the hostcommand task? I didn\u0027t see one.",
      "parentUuid": "c73914d3_b3dca128",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 1,
