        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-20T18:10:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I wasn\u0027t fully picking up on what was happening here. Now I that I know that we are spoofing the AP sending host commands, this makese more sense. You do not need to schedule this on the host cammand task, and it would likely cause issues if you did.\n\nThis way if fine. Let\u0027s add comments here and to the function that this is replicate behavior as if the AP was sending this Host command to us.",
