      "writtenOn": "2020-05-17T04:44:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This one should hopefully be triggered by AP FW, though I do suspect they\u0027ll need a simpler interface for it (i.e. I don\u0027t think coreboot/depthcharge will want to compose VDMs).  This point should be further in the future though so we have a while to figure it out.",
